  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $\\Gamma$ be a finite simple group and let $N_n(\\Gamma)$ denote the set of normal subgroups of the free group $F_n$ of rank $n$ whose quotient is isomorphic to $\\Gamma$.\n\nConjecture: $\\operatorname{Aut}(F_n)$ acts transitively on $N_n(\\Gamma)$ for $n\\geqslant 3$.",
